	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
	\L_0394f:
	ZH 1:
	'　　＜drip...）'
	\L_039cc:
	ZH 1:
	'　　＜...drip...）'
	\L_039cc:
	ZH 1:
	'The sound of dripping water'
	R
	'hitting the floor came from'
	R
	'somewhere unknown.'
	\L_039cc:
	ZH 1:
	'There was no sunlight to shine,'
	R
	'and there was no wind to'
	R
	'gently cool the cheeks.'
	\L_039cc:
	ZH 1:
	'In that gloomy, humid dungeon'
	R
	'was Ex.'
	\L_039cc:
	ZH 1:
	'The locked door was only to be'
	R
	'opened again in 1,000,000'
	R
	'years...'
	\L_039cc:
	ZH 1:
	'No human can possibly live'
	R
	'that long.'
	\L_039cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Ex would live in that dungeon'
	R
	'for the rest of his life.'
	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
