	\L_0396b:
	\L_038a7:
	ZH 1:
	'I dunno. The crime of opposing'
	R
	'me is heavy. 1,000,000 tons,'
	R
	'in fact.'
	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
	\L_03917:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
	\L_038a7:
	ZH 1:
	'.........'
	\L_039cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Not laughing at my joke just'
	R
	'now is only making your crimes'
	R
	'heavier. 1,050,000 tons.'
	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
	\L_03917:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
	\L_038a7:
	ZH 1:
	'Hmph, well... Whatever.'
	R
	'I’ll make a special exception'
	R
	'for you and add you to my army.'
	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
	\L_03917:
	ZH 1:
	'...Does that mean you’re'
	R
	'forgiving me?'
	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
	\L_038a7:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s right.'
	R
	'Pretty generous, huh?!!'
	R
	'Gahahahahaha.'
	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
	\L_03917:
	ZH 1:
	'...I greatly appreciate it...'
	R
	'However...'
	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
	\L_038a7:
	ZH 1:
	'Hm?'
	R
	'Are you dissatisfied?'
	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
	\L_03917:
	ZH 1:
	'I can’t join you.'
	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
	\L_038a7:
	ZH 1:
	'Why?'
	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
	\L_03917:
	ZH 1:
	'...I can’t do it in the face'
	R
	'of all those that died for the'
	R
	'rebellion.'
	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
	\L_038a7:
	ZH 1:
	'Then you’re saying you won’t'
	R
	'lend your power to the'
	R
	'rebuilding of Leazas.'
	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
	\L_03917:
	ZH 1:
	'...I deeply apologize.'
	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
	\L_038a7:
	ZH 1:
	'Hm...'
	\L_039cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Got it, then get out.'
	R
	'I don’t want to see your face'
	R
	'again.'
	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
	\L_03917:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
	\L_038a7:
	ZH 1:
	'Hmph, even if I killed you,'
	R
	'your blood would just stain'
	R
	'the floor.'
	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
	\L_03917:
	ZH 1:
	'...King Rance.'
	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
	\L_038a7:
	ZH 1:
	'What?'
	R
	'Want to be killed?'
	\L_039cc:
	ZH 1:
	'If you do, then stay here.'
	R
	'If you don’t, then gather your'
	R
	'things and get out.'
	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
	\L_03917:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_039cc:
	\L_039bf:
	\L_0394f:
	ZH 1:
	'Ex slowly stood up, bowed'
	R
	'deeply to Rance and turned'
	R
	'away from the throne.'
	\L_039cc:
